<ParamField path="organizationId" type={"string"} required>

</ParamField>

<ParamField path="projectId" type={"string"} required>
The project being billed.
</ParamField>


## Body

<ParamField body="category" type={"string"} required>
Category slug, e.g. analytics or messaging.
</ParamField>


## Returns

**`200`** Removes a scheduled cancellation so the category renews normally. ResumeSubscriptionResponse

<ResponseField name="category" type={"string"} required>
Category slug, e.g. analytics or messaging.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="resumed" type={"boolean"} required>
False when the subscription was not scheduled to cancel.
</ResponseField>

